# Stored evidence bodies. The LEDGER is published -- evidence/ledger.jsonl
# and claims.jsonl carry every URL, sha256, byte count and collection date,
# so any artifact can be re-fetched and verified. The BODIES are not, because
# 33 of them are copies of published papers we cannot redistribute.
evidence/raw/

